description: Keep Dockerfiles, Compose files, and YAML examples accurate for the Docker curriculum.
globs: **/Dockerfile*,**/.dockerignore,**/docker-compose*.yml,**/docker-compose*.yaml,**/*.yml,**/*.yaml
